      "last_edit_date": 1721313801,
      "message_parsed": "<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 80, 65)\">Используйте лучше <a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/threads/vyvod-avatarov-v-memberlist-php-polzovateli.42159/\" class=\"link link--internal\">этот мод</a></span>&#8203;</div><hr />Автор:Nightmare<br />\nСложность: ну куда уж легче<br />\nВремя сколько заняло написание мода:две минуты, так между делом<br />\nmemberlist.php<br />\nНайти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$sql = &quot;SELECT username, user_id, user_rank, user_opt, user_posts, user_regdate, user_from, user_website, user_email</pre>Найти в строке<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">user_email</pre>Вставить после<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">, user_avatar, user_avatar_type</pre>Найти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&#039;USER&#039;          =&gt; profile_url($row),</pre>Вставить после<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&#039;USER_AVATAR&#039;          =&gt; get_avatar($row[&#039;user_avatar&#039;], $row[&#039;user_avatar_type&#039;], !bf($row[&#039;user_opt&#039;], &#039;user_opt&#039;, &#039;allow_avatar&#039;)),</pre><br />\ntemplates/default/memberlist.tpl<br />\nНайти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">    &lt;th class=&quot;{sorter: &#039;digit&#039;}&quot; &gt;&lt;b class=&quot;tbs-text&quot;&gt;#&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;</pre>Вставить после<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&lt;th class=&quot;{sorter: false}&quot; &gt;&lt;b class=&quot;tbs-text&quot;&gt;{L_AVATAR}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;</pre>Найти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&lt;td&gt;{memberrow.ROW_NUMBER}&lt;/td&gt;</pre>Вставить после<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&lt;td&gt;{memberrow.USER_AVATAR}&lt;/td&gt;</pre>Автор: kenny,mr.Stalker Evolution Torrent Tracker<br />\nmemberlist.php<br />\n=========================================================================<br />\nНайти<br />\n   <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\"> $lang[&#039;SORT_TOP_TEN&#039;]</pre>Заменить на<br />\n    <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$lang[&#039;SORT_TOP_TEN&#039;],\n    $lang[&#039;Avatar&#039;]</pre>Найти<br />\n<br />\n    [/php]&#039;topten&#039;<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">Заменить на\n\n [php]   &#039;topten&#039;,\n    &#039;avatar&#039;</pre>Найти<br />\n    <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">case &#039;topten&#039;:\n        $order_by = &quot;user_posts $sort_order LIMIT 10&quot;;\n        break;</pre><br />\nДобавить после<br />\n    <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">case &#039;avatar&#039;:\n        $order_by = &quot;user_avatar $sort_order LIMIT $start, &quot; . $board_config[&#039;topics_per_page&#039;];\n        break;</pre>templates/default/memberlist.tpl<br />\nНайти<br />\n<br />\n   <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\"> &lt;th&gt;{L_USERNAME}&lt;/th&gt;</pre><br />\nДобавить после<br />\n<br />\n   <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\"> &lt;th&gt;{L_USERAVATAR}&lt;/th&gt;</pre><br />\nНайти<br />\n<br />\n    <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;{memberrow.U_VIEWPROFILE}&quot; class=&quot;gen&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;{memberrow.USERNAME}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;</pre><br />\nДобавить после<br />\n<br />\n    <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&lt;td class=&quot;{memberrow.ROW_CLASS}&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;{memberrow.AVATAR_IMG}&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;</pre><br />\nНайти<br />\n    <pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&lt;td class=&quot;catBottom&quot; colspan=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;[php]\nЗаменить на\n\n    [php]&lt;td class=&quot;catBottom&quot; colspan=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;</pre><br />\nСохраняем файлы.<br />\nСмотрим <a href=\"http://YOURDOMAIN.COM/forum/memberlist.php\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">http://YOURDOMAIN.COM/forum/memberlist.php</a><br />\nПацанские моды без лишнего, кому какой нравится, мы просто между делом написали.Моя версия написано давно, версия Nightmare сегодня.<br />\nСкрин<br />\n<img src=\"http://opennix.ru/pix/uploads/128.73.148.46_190112-232142_avatar.png\" alt=\"\" />",
