      "message_parsed": "<b>Дополнение </b><br />\nнайти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"html\">&lt;td&gt;{memberrow.USER_AVATAR}&lt;/td&gt;</pre>заменить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"html\">&lt;td&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ava&quot;&gt;{memberrow.USER_AVATAR}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;</pre>в css<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">.ava img{height: 48px; width: 48px;}</pre>Результ<br />\n<a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/678/\"><img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/data/attachments/0/678-1b6dd05244c8fa13666690a17177fc1a.jpg?hash=6512z-w6sC\" alt=\"Снимок.webp\" /></a><br />\n <br />\nНу можно сделать с обводкой . Кому как<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">.ava img{height: 48px; width: 48px; background-color:#fcfcff;padding:2px;border:1px\nsolid #c4cad4; border-radius:4px;-webkit-border-radius:4px;-moz-border-radius:4px;-khtml-border-radius:4px;}</pre>",
