АВИТЬ ПОСЛЕ\n \n&lt;td&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ava&quot;&gt;{memberrow.USER_AVATAR}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n-------------------------------\nВ CSS\n.ava img{height: 48px; width: 48px; background-color:#fcfcff;padding:2px;border:1px\nsolid #c4cad4; border-radius:4px;-webkit-border-radius:4px;-moz-border-radius:4px;-khtml-border-radius:4px;}</pre>",
