      "message_parsed": "<u>для ревизии <b>583 и выше</b>:</u><br />\n <br />\nоткрыть <b>memberlist.php</b><br />\n <br />\n<i>найти</i><br />\n <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">&#039;USER&#039;          =&gt; profile_url($row),</pre> <br />\n<i>вставить после</i><br />\n <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">&#039;THIS_AVATAR&#039;  =&gt; get_avatar($userdata[&#039;user_id&#039;], $userdata[&#039;avatar_ext_id&#039;], &#039;allow_avatar&#039;),</pre> <br />\nоткрыть <b>memberlist.tpl</b><br />\n <br />\n<i>найти </i><br />\n <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">&lt;th class=&quot;{sorter: &#039;text&#039;}&quot; &gt;&lt;b class=&quot;tbs-text&quot;&gt;{L_USERNAME}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;</pre> <br />\n<i>вставить после</i><br />\n <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">&lt;th class=&quot;{sorter: false}&quot; &gt;&lt;b class=&quot;tbs-text&quot;&gt;{L_AVATAR}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;</pre> <br />\n<i>найти </i><br />\n <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;{memberrow.USER}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;</pre> <br />\n<i>вставить после</i><br />\n <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">&lt;td&gt;{memberrow.THIS_AVATAR}&lt;/td&gt;</pre>",
